msgid ". When you click Submit, system will add all these documents and will copy a blank \".DOCX\" files against each document. You can edit these documents to add your content.To edit, goto each document and click edit icon. To add HTML Forms, goto each document's view page and click on Database icon at the bottom. It will take you to the HTML Form Builder. Based on the document, select the HTML Form and click download and save the form. System will then create HTML form for that document. Repeat this step for each document."
